This subpackage contains Gohufont, A font for programming and terminal 
use. TrueType automatically traced, with available bitmaps in heights of 
11 and 14 pixels.

Copyright 2010 by Hugo Chargois (http://font.gohu.eu)
Converted by Guilherme Maeda (github.com/koemaeda)

For more information have a look at the upstream websites: 
http://font.gohu.org/ https://github.com/koemaeda/gohufont-ttf
